Yes, admins have full control to disable Nova workspace-wide.

- **Disable toggle**: Admins can turn off Nova entirely at the workspace level via Settings → AI [1].
- **No impact on core features**: Turning off Nova doesn't affect any non-AI functionality [1].

For more on how Nova handles data when enabled, see [Security details](https://northline.com/security) or check https://northline.com/product/ai for setup info.